Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:02.46,Titulo,,0,0,0,,{\c&H7373F7&\2c&H54E8F2&\3c&HBC71B8&\4c&H995A8F&}Ghost Meets Gal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The school entrance ceremony is pretty boring, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now our principal would deliver a welcoming speech.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So that person is....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings to our freshmen this year, \NI am the school principal Krysrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This academy is the place that gathers idols-in-training who are coming from different nations and races, 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and those with different quirks will improve through competitions.\NI am looking forward to witnessing the very best idol arise from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.15,0:00:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are always students being enrolled here every year, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How many years does it take to complete the curriculum though?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, does the concept of “graduation” even exist here to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So hypothetically if we get to stay here until we become granny....do we get to debut as “granny idol”?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I am a Ghost, so I will not age at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?! I am so jealous of you! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So...that means you will not die even if you hit the so-called life expectancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I am a Ghost....so technically I am already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh....for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry for your loss....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I am quite humbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\pos(200.8,27.733)}(Inside the dormitory){\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming up is our introduction to the dormitory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.35,0:00:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Y..yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:01:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who I will end up sharing the room with?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(190.4,286.933)}Speak of which, I went shopping immediately after getting the nails done...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(198.4,27.733)} I see...{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I may not end up in the same room with Santhi-chan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so that means I gotta speak with new strangers....{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.25,0:01:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ahhhh! {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}what happen if I end up meeting scary folks?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eeek....I am getting nervous now!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.08,0:01:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that unpopped thingy from popcorns end up getting into my eyes....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lubna-chi? 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She disappeared again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.60,0:01:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,, I...I am sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! You are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have disappeared again due to extreme nervousness....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Does my topic making people THAT nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:36.09,parte final da música ghost meets gal,,0,0,0,,Looking down, sighing, \Nhiding my true feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:38.78,parte final da música ghost meets gal,,0,0,0,,Every time i step forward, \Neven if i'm trembling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:41.64,parte final da música ghost meets gal,,0,0,0,,I can't lie to my desire of change!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.76,0:01:44.38,parte final da música ghost meets gal,,0,0,0,,It's surely a distant dream right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:47.40,parte final da música ghost meets gal,,0,0,0,,but i want to chase it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:50.37,parte final da música ghost meets gal,,0,0,0,,Even if our futures are different colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:53.27,parte final da música ghost meets gal,,0,0,0,,Let's paint them with the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:56.77,parte final da música ghost meets gal,,0,0,0,,Because you are the one who gives me courage!
